<p>    Breeding males		  6		145	   87</p>
<p>    Breeding females	     88		268	   89</p>
<p>	Hogs			 Week	     Year   Year Ago</p>
<p>    Slaughter			 0		188     13,024</p>
<p>    Breeding males		  0		 75	    7</p>
<p>    Breeding females		0		536	   30</p>
<p>	Dairy			Week	     Year   Year Ago</p>
